WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Open + and choose Attach to bring in new material.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Choose files or a folder. Or connect a data source.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Expand Your sources and open the folder you want to use.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Download an editable copy: changes stay in CLIO.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
The folder is attached. Add your request, then send.
